{"seq":1,"slug":"flexbox-mastery","title":"Flexbox 精通","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/layout-systems/flexbox-mastery","wordCount":580,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"flexbox-精通\">Flexbox 精通</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>Flexbox（弹性盒子布局）是 CSS 中最常用的一维布局系统。它通过<strong>主轴/交叉轴</strong>模型，让元素的对齐、分布和伸缩变得直观而强大。无论是导航栏、卡片列表还是表单布局，Flexbox 都是首选方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Flexbox 以一条<strong>主轴</strong>（<code>flex-direction</code> 决定方向）和与之垂直的<strong>交叉轴</strong>为基础，容器通过 <code>justify-content</code>/<code>align-items</code> 控制子项在这两轴上的分布与对齐，子项则通过 <code>flex-grow</code>/<code>flex-shrink</code>/<code>flex-basis</code> 决定如何伸缩以填满或让出剩余空间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Flex 容器&quot;&#10;        direction LR&#10;        A[&quot;Item 1&quot;] ~~~ B[&quot;Item 2&quot;] ~~~ C[&quot;Item 3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    MA[&quot;主轴 Main Axis →&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    CA[&quot;交叉轴 Cross Axis ↓&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Flex 容器\"\n        direction LR\n        A[\"Item 1\"] ~~~ B[\"Item 2\"] ~~~ C[\"Item 3\"]\n    end\n    MA[\"主轴 Main Axis →\"] --&gt; A\n    CA[\"交叉轴 Cross Axis ↓\"]</pre><h2 id=\"主轴与交叉轴\">主轴与交叉轴</h2><p>Flexbox 的一切都围绕两条轴展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>默认方向</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主轴（Main Axis）</td>\n<td>水平从左到右</td>\n<td>元素排列方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉轴（Cross Axis）</td>\n<td>垂直从上到下</td>\n<td>与主轴垂直的方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".row {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;  flex-direction: row; /* 主轴水平（默认） */&#10;}&#10;&#10;.column {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;  flex-direction: column; /* 主轴垂直 */&#10;}&#10;&#10;.row-reverse {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;  flex-direction: row-reverse; /* 主轴水平反转 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 主轴水平（默认） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 主轴垂直 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.row-reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">row-reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 主轴水平反转 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>flex-direction</code> 改变的是主轴方向，这意味着 <code>justify-content</code> 和 <code>align-items</code> 的作用方向也随之改变。在 <code>column</code> 模式下，<code>justify-content</code> 控制垂直分布。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"flex-grow-flex-shrink-flex-basis\">flex-grow / flex-shrink / flex-basis</h2><p>这三个属性控制 flex item 如何分配剩余空间和收缩：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".item {&#10;  flex-grow: 0; /* 默认不放大 */&#10;  flex-shrink: 1; /* 默认可收缩 */&#10;  flex-basis: auto; /* 默认基于内容或 width */&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 简写 */&#10;.item {&#10;  flex: 0 1 auto;&#10;} /* 默认值 */&#10;.item {&#10;  flex: 1;&#10;} /* = flex: 1 1 0%，均分空间 */&#10;.item {&#10;  flex: auto;&#10;} /* = flex: 1 1 auto，基于内容均分 */&#10;.item {&#10;  flex: none;&#10;} /* = flex: 0 0 auto，不伸缩 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-grow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 默认不放大 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-shrink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 默认可收缩 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 默认基于内容或 width */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 简写 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 默认值 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* = flex: 1 1 0%，均分空间 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* = flex: 1 1 auto，基于内容均分 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* = flex: 0 0 auto，不伸缩 */</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;flex: 1 的均分效果&quot;&#10;        direction LR&#10;        A1[&quot;Item 1 flex:1&quot;] ~~~ A2[&quot;Item 2 flex:1&quot;] ~~~ A3[&quot;Item 3 flex:1&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;flex-grow 不同比例&quot;&#10;        direction LR&#10;        B1[&quot;Item 1 flex:1&quot;] ~~~ B2[&quot;Item 2 flex:2&quot;] ~~~ B3[&quot;Item 3 flex:1&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"flex: 1 的均分效果\"\n        direction LR\n        A1[\"Item 1 flex:1\"] ~~~ A2[\"Item 2 flex:1\"] ~~~ A3[\"Item 3 flex:1\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"flex-grow 不同比例\"\n        direction LR\n        B1[\"Item 1 flex:1\"] ~~~ B2[\"Item 2 flex:2\"] ~~~ B3[\"Item 3 flex:1\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"计算公式\">计算公式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"实际尺寸 = flex-basis + (剩余空间 × flex-grow / 总 flex-grow)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>实际尺寸 = flex-basis + (剩余空间 × flex-grow / 总 flex-grow)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>示例：容器 600px，三个 item 的 flex-basis 都是 100px：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>flex-grow</th>\n<th>分配额外空间</th>\n<th>最终宽度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>300 × 1/4 = 75px</td>\n<td>175px</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>300 × 2/4 = 150px</td>\n<td>250px</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>300 × 1/4 = 75px</td>\n<td>175px</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"对齐系统\">对齐系统</h2><p>Flexbox 提供了完整的对齐能力：</p>\n<h3 id=\"主轴对齐-justify-content\">主轴对齐 — justify-content</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".container {&#10;  display: flex;&#10;  justify-content: flex-start; /* 起始对齐（默认） */&#10;  justify-content: flex-end; /* 末尾对齐 */&#10;  justify-content: center; /* 居中 */&#10;  justify-content: space-between; /* 两端对齐，间距相等 */&#10;  justify-content: space-around; /* 每项两侧等间距 */&#10;  justify-content: space-evenly; /* 所有间距完全相等 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex-start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 起始对齐（默认） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flex-end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 末尾对齐 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 居中 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">space-between</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 两端对齐，间距相等 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  justify-content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-d