-dark:#79B8FF\">flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex-direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  min-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">vh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  flex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin-top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"order-属性\">order 属性</h2><p><code>order</code> 可以改变视觉排列顺序而不改变 DOM 顺序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".item:nth-child(3) {&#10;  order: -1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.item:nth-child</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>order</code> 时要注意无障碍——屏幕阅读器仍然按 DOM 顺序读取内容。视觉顺序与 DOM 顺序不一致可能导致 Tab 导航混乱。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Flexbox 是<strong>一维</strong>布局系统，通过主轴/交叉轴模型工作</li>\n<li><strong><code>flex-grow/shrink/basis</code></strong> 控制 item 如何分配和收缩空间，<code>flex: 1</code> 是最常用简写</li>\n<li><strong><code>justify-content</code></strong> 控制主轴分布，<strong><code>align-items</code></strong> 控制交叉轴对齐</li>\n<li><strong><code>gap</code></strong> 替代了 margin hack，是设置间距的标准方式</li>\n<li>经典模式：完美居中、导航栏、等高卡片、粘性底部都可用简洁的 Flexbox 实现</li>\n<li><code>order</code> 可调整视觉顺序，但要注意无障碍影响</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Flexbox 精通","id":"flexbox-精通"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主轴与交叉轴","id":"主轴与交叉轴"},{"level":2,"text":"flex-grow / flex-shrink / flex-basis","id":"flex-grow-flex-shrink-flex-basis"},{"level":3,"text":"计算公式","id":"计算公式"},{"level":2,"text":"对齐系统","id":"对齐系统"},{"level":3,"text":"主轴对齐 — justify-content","id":"主轴对齐-justify-content"},{"level":3,"text":"交叉轴对齐 — align-items / align-self","id":"交叉轴对齐-align-items-align-self"},{"level":3,"text":"gap 间距","id":"gap-间距"},{"level":2,"text":"换行与多行对齐","id":"换行与多行对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"常见布局模式","id":"常见布局模式"},{"level":3,"text":"完美居中","id":"完美居中"},{"level":3,"text":"导航栏：Logo 左 + 链接右","id":"导航栏-logo-左-链接右"},{"level":3,"text":"等高卡片","id":"等高卡片"},{"level":3,"text":"粘性底部","id":"粘性底部"},{"level":2,"text":"order 属性","id":"order-属性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CSS 自定义属性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/css-variables"},"next":{"title":"Grid 精通","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/layout-systems/grid-mastery"}}